<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear
<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[BPL Name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">**Add
personal introduction**</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank
you for all that you are doing for patients in need! I so appreciate your
effects to increase Type O collections.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0070C0"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Did you know that type O blood is most
requested by hospitals and is often in short supply? In emergency situations
when there’s no time to determine a patient’s blood type or for immune
deficient infants, doctors reach for type O blood.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The recruitment actions you take as a Blood
Program Leader can directly impact our ability to respond to hospital demand
and help ensure patients get the blood they need.<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Tips for success at your upcoming blood drive:<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:
     10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Use the <span style="background:
     yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">attached type O info sheet and donor email
     template</span> <span style="color:red">[NOTE: Available on the <a href="https://americanredcross.sharepoint.com/teams/TheField/SitePages/Type-O-Blood-Support.aspx"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:
     minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
     mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi">Type O Field page</span></a>; ATTACH to
     email] </span>to recruit eligible type O blood donors.</span></span>&nbsp;</li></ul>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:
     10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Before the blood drive, make a
     personal call to type O donors, reminding them why their appointment is
     needed and thank them for scheduling an appointment to give blood.</span></span>&nbsp;</li></ul>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-add-space:auto;
     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:
     10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">If a Power Red device is assigned
     to the blood drive, ensure the type O donor is educated on the process
     and, if eligible, is encouraged to donate </span></span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/how-to-donate/types-of-blood-donations/power-red-donation.html#prelig">Power
     Red</a><span class="normaltextrun">.<o:p></o:p></span></span></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Thank you again for your commitment to our
lifesaving mission. I am confident that with some additional efforts, you will
increase your type O donors. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate
to reach out – I’m always here to help!</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1">Best regards,</span><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Name]<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Title]<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Your Email]<span style="color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
